    "title": "OC mother charged with felony after son's electric motorcycle crash leaves veteran critically injured - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexa Mae Asperin ,\n11 hours ago Tommi Jo Mejer, was charged with felony child endangerment after her son allegedly struck and critically injured an 81-year-old man while riding an illegal E-motorcycle. Prosecutors allege Mejer ignored previous police warnings about the vehicle—which is 16 times more powerful than a legal E-bike—and initially lied to investigators about owning it. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 67",
